Package: ROCS
Type: Package
Title: Receiver Operating Characteristics Surface
Version: 1.4
Date: 2025-05-23
Author: Tianwei Yu [aut, cre],
  Peizhou Liao [ctb]
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Tianwei",
